":"I hope in his word.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"My soul longs for the Lord more than watchmen long for the morning,","poem":1},{"text":"more than watchmen for the morning.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"Israel, hope in the LORD,","poem":1},{"text":"for there is loving kindness with the LORD.","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Abundant redemption is with him.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"He will redeem Israel from all their sins.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":81,"caller":"+","text":"LORD or GOD in all caps is from the Hebrew יהוה Yahweh except when otherwise noted as being from the short form יה Yah.","reference":{"chapter":130,"verse":1}},{"noteId":82,"caller":"+","text":"Hebrew: יה Yah","reference":{"chapter":130,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/eng_weu/PSA/130.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_weu/PSA/131.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_weu/PSA/129.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}